# ── ML Artifacts ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# model_store/ is an old pipeline — dead code, not used by the live app.
# backend/data/models/*.joblib are trained model binaries — too large for git,
# must be retrained on each environment. Only the registry JSONL is tracked.
model_store/
*.joblib
*.pkl

# Trained model binaries (explicit paths in case *.joblib glob misses nested)
backend/data/models/*.joblib

# Registry backup files (auto-generated by inspect_models --clean-test)
backend/data/models/*.jsonl.bak
model_store/*.jsonl.bak

# Agent report snapshots (latest.md is tracked, timestamped ones are not)
.claude/reports/model_report_*.md

# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
